# Excludes for the CodeBuild app source zip (data.archive_file.app in build.tf).
# This file is the single source of truth; build.tf parses it, so change the
# list here rather than in HCL. It applies to every built app, including a
# caller's build_path tree.
#
# Each non-empty line is a doublestar glob matched against a path relative to
# the app tree. A `*` does not cross `/`, so a name that can appear at any depth
# needs a `**/` prefix; `**/` also matches at the top level. There is no `!`
# negation, so the list only subtracts. Lines starting with `#` and blank lines
# are ignored.
#
# The list covers local build state, VCS metadata, and Chainlit runtime files.
.venv
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache
dist
.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
**/.DS_Store
assets/.files
assets/.chainlit/translations
